  - day: 2
    sender: "E\u015Fin"
    family: 1
    text: "Elif yine \xE7antay\u0131 sordu. Bir de odas\u0131ndaki dolap \xE7ok uzun;
      \xF6\u011Fretmen duvara vidalay\u0131n demi\u015F."
    condition: 2
    item: 0
    other: {fileID: 0}
    seal: 0
    threshold: 0
    timing: 1
    fileOfDay: 1
  - day: 2
    sender: "E\u015Fin"
    family: 1
    text: "\xC7anta kap\u0131n\u0131n yan\u0131nda, Elif fenerini i\xE7ine koydu.
      Ama odas\u0131ndaki dolap \xE7ok uzun; \xF6\u011Fretmen duvara vidalay\u0131n
